      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the File and Provider**\n\nI'm starting by establishing the foundation: I need a Python file, `summarize_text.py`. The core will involve integrating a hosted LLM. I've decided to move forward with Google Cloud's Vertex AI to accomplish this.\n\n\n**Outlining the Python File**\n\nI've sketched out the Python file structure: `summarize_text.py` is the name. I'm focusing on Vertex AI's `text-bison` model for text summarization. The core function, `summarize_text`, will handle the LLM interaction. It'll import Vertex AI libraries, initialize the environment, and load the model. Now, I need to implement the function, including the `predict` call.\n\n\n",
